MODIFICATION NOTICE (Apache-2.0 Section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution contains modifications to the original Nerve source. The
complete, itemized list of changes is maintained in:

    docs/zeroleak/MODIFICATIONS.md

Summary of the changes carried by ZeroLeak AI:

  1. Product name and branding changed from "Nerve" to "ZeroLeak AI",
     including application identity, icons, window and tray presentation, and
     the on-disk state directory.
  2. Air-gapped / local-only security posture stated and enforced as a product
     requirement.
  3. Provider surface restricted to local runtimes (llama.cpp, Ollama, vLLM,
     approved local Python runtimes, and optional private on-premise
     OpenAI-compatible endpoints). Public cloud providers are not offered.
  4. Local model lifecycle management added (import, configure, test, enable,
     disable, load, unload) with persistence.
  5. Transcription retargeted from a hosted service to local speech-to-text:
     audio is decoded by the whisper.cpp CLI runtime on the same machine
     (multilingual Tiny/Base/Small models), and the hosted ChatGPT
     transcription path is removed.

